<title>GERMANY: Daimler to sell stake in Cap Gemini.</title>
<headline>Daimler to sell stake in Cap Gemini.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daimler-Benz AG said on Wednesday it was no longer seeking a takeover of French software house Cap Gemini and would sell its 24.4 percent stake in the firm in the medium term by issuing a convertible bond.</p>
<p>Daimler said in a statement the U.S. Bank Holding Company Act was continuing to hamper expansion in the important U.S. information technology market. Its services unit debis AG had therefore declined the option of acquiring a majority holding in Cap Gemini.</p>
</text>
